WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:53.290
Someone once said...

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.190
There are chickens which,

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:02.660
will turn into freshly-fried 
chicken nuggets...

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:10.500
Chicken Rinuggets!

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:14.810
When the tail of one kind of giraffe 
spins around like for a raffle,

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:19.150
the pattern on its body turns 
into sweet confections...

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:23.020
Giraffles!

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.820
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:31.390
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:37.860
Heaven or Hell?! Storming 
Into the Gourmet Casino!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.030
That's good stuff!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:11.100
It takes forever to get there 
via underground railway,

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.870
but I'm so psyched about 
going to the pleasure zone!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.400
Pleasure zone, Toriko-san?

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.070
This train doesn't really look like 
it'd be going to a fun place...

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:24.480
This train runs 500 meters below the 
surface. The Underground Train...

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:29.210
It's the only railway that goes to 
the the center of the Jiddal Kingdom.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.850
The Jiddal Kingdom...

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:36.890
Coco went there before, to do his training.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:38.890
What kind of country is it?

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:41.560
Jiddal is a country that's 
under international oversight.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.360
It's a region where Gourmet 
crimes run rampant.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.730
Even on this train, there are 
plenty of shady characters

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.600
that'd make you shake in your boots, Komatsu.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:53.370
But why is the world's number one 
casino in a country like that?

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.440
Because it's not an IGO member nation.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:57.440
It's not a member nation...

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:01.810
In the Gourmet Age, the most valuable 
thing of all isn't money or jewels.

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:03.410
It's ingredients, right?

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:07.250
Exactly. And in Jiddal, there 
are many underground routes

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:10.120
where ingredients that aren't accessible 
through legal channels may be obtained.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:14.820
You see, they're not bound by the Eight 
Gourmet Laws as established by IGO.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.730
In other words, it's a lawless land?

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:20.400
By and large, they traffic 
in poison ingredients

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.770
and narcotic ingredients 
that are used in crimes.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.410
I think I remember hearing they sell poison 
Puffer Whales right out in the open.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:35.540
But there are many high-grade ingredients 
that are hard to come by legally,

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.050
yet make the rounds of the black market.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:43.990
And one of them is our target 
this time... Meteor Garlic.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.850
Meteor Garlic?

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:48.960
It's mysterious garlic that's 
said to very occasionally grow

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.690
in land where a meteorite has fallen.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:54.560
It grows by sucking all of the 
nutrients out of the ground nearby.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.810
So it's fortified with nutrients 
like you wouldn't believe.

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:06.780
Apparently, if you eat it,

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:10.810
it gives you enough energy to go 
a whole month without sleeping.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.550
It's restricted under the Eight Gourmet Laws,

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:18.050
but it's so valuable, you never get 
the chance to see it on the market.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:19.790
But in the underworld...

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:24.930
Yep. Word is that it's being used 
as a prize at the Gourmet Casino.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:28.600
At the moment, it's said all ingredients 
that are normally out of reach

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.970
are being gathered in Jiddal.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.200
In that case, even a casino would be 
able to flaunt all kinds of ingredients

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.570
that are unavailable through legal means.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.840
Maybe that's why they call this one 
the best Gourmet Casino in the world.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:45.550
Damn the old man. Now gambling 
is gonna be part of our training?

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:52.150
Well, anyway, this'll be my first time 
tryin' for an ingredient by gambling.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.010
I'm... hungry...

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.350
A limited express freight train...

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.590
Food...

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.230
Hey!

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.510
Whoa! Don't touch that!

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.420
This is an Electric Banana.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.490
Relax. I'm with the Gourmet Mafia.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:05.720
Here. I wouldn't feed you anything weird.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:15.030
We're here! So this is 
the Jiddal Kingdom, huh?

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.340
Well, well, well...

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.440
Welcome, dapper gents!

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:24.110
Welcome to the crime kingdom of Jiddal!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.910
Are you here for sightseeing?

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.710
Huh. You're a big one, ain't ya?

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.850
I bet he eats tasty food.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.480
Nice threads, too...

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:35.520
Let's get to it. Give us the 
suit. You can keep the undies.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:39.260
Whoa, is this a thing? They're pickin' 
a fight with me! Right, Coco?

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.420
Why are you happy about it?

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:44.030
This is a precious moment! How often do 
normal humans try to tussle with me?!

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.290
True...

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:49.900
I guess a lot of people in non-member 
nations haven't heard of you, Toriko-san.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.570
Shut up, punk! We don't know any of you!

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:54.800
Um, here's some friendly advice:

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.010
I wouldn't antagonize 
Toriko-san if I were you...

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.980
I told you to shut it! 
But never mind, just die!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.580
Scary!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.810
Eat lead!

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.290
He caught the bullet with his fingers?!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.030
Who the hell is this guy?!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:22.600
I'm Gourmet Hunter Toriko! Remember it!

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:30.740
This is a fun town!

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.170
I won't get bored here!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:35.040
It's just a dangerous place!

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:38.810
Dangerous? Whenever we travel in the 
great outdoors, <i>that's</i> dangerous!

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:42.180
At least the great outdoors 
has a set of rules...

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:46.120
The Food Crucible. That's 
this country's nickname.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:51.830
Every ingredient under the sun, both 
good and bad, is jumbled together here,

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.890
and they stimulate people's desires.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.630
It's both chaotic and absurd.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.100
A town where evil swaggers around...

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:00.900
This is the black market.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:03.970
Wow! It sure is lively!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:04.800
Underground Vegetables

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:08.370
The town's market has tons of ingredients 
obtained from illegal channels.

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:06.610
Poison

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:13.610
Poison Puffer Whale! They really do sell it!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.110
I don't know if that's a good idea...

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.120
They're delicious! Although 
you'll die if you eat it...

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:18.350
Uh, no thanks!

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:23.560
How about one of these, young 
man? I'll sell it to you cheap.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:25.790
What is that?

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.290
Let's go, Komatsu.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.390
It's cheap...

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:29.330
Later.

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:29.900
Young man...

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.530
Wait for me, Toriko-san!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.530
Young man...

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.670
They're called Poison Stars.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.930
They're pieces of an asteroid 
that act as a powerful drug.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:38.740
Eat even one and you'll 
get hooked, apparently.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.640
In the past, when Poison 
Stars were going around,

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:44.340
one entire city with a population 
of a million people collapsed.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.180
And there's a lot more...

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.410
These are Drug Snails.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:52.020
They're kept completely isolated 
from people in normal countries.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.290
You'd be arrested just for 
picking up one of their shells.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.460
One bite of an Electric Banana sends 
an electric current through your body.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.390
It's classified as a class 
2 narcotic ingredient.

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:02.690
All of these ingredients are dangerous, huh?

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:06.660
Yep. And between endangered species and 
illegal selectively-bred ingredients,

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.330
there are too many to count.

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:10.770
Look at this!

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:14.770
These are Juicytake! They're an incredibly 
expensive, top-class ingredient!

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:18.480
Why don't you buy some? I'm sure 
they'll come in handy at the casino.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:19.410
Good idea.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.410
I'll have some Juicytake!

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:24.720
Why would we need ingredients at the casino?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.620
There are some games where 
you gamble with food.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.590
Huh...

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:31.390
Gambling with food...

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.260
That's...

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:39.000
The buildings around here 
are mostly modern hotels...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:42.200
And the people seem a lot different.

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:45.840
Famous Gourmet families that 
like to gamble and VIPs

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:48.770
come from all over the world 
to stay and play here.

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.210
Are we close to the Gourmet Casino?

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.180
The Gourmet Casino is right in front of you.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.010
I'm starvin!

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:55.780
Toriko-san!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.650
Toriko-san, really?

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.260
This is the Gourmet Casino!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:20.000
Well, shall we try our luck?

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:38.020
Wow... The casino at night...

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.490
What a luxurious town!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.830
And it's enormous!

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:49.300
There are over a million Gourmet 
Casinos all over the world,

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:52.270
but this one boasts the largest size 
and ability to attract customers.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:55.600
For a casino that deals 
in illegal ingredients,

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:57.540
it's got an overwhelmingly grand scale.

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:01.380
Hundreds of trillions of yen 
flow through here every day.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.940
It truly is a gambling kingdom.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.310
Hundreds of trillions of yen?!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.780
I can't even imagine that much!

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:12.520
There are first-class, ten star hotels 
and restaurants lined up side by side.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:17.190
Right now, this is the Jiddal Kingdom's 
greatest tourist attraction.

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.790
It's true!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:23.100
This place is full of high-class restaurants 
you don't even see in Gourmet Town!

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:26.730
Since the streets before were dangerous, 
I had a lousy impression of this place,

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:29.070
but now Jiddal Kingdom 
looks like paradise to me!

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.710
You know that face is illegal, Komatsu.

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:34.810
Robber!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.410
Stop him!

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.550
My money...

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.820
I guess it isn't safe even 
in this part of town.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.390
It's because the casino is 
basically a lawless area.

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:49.120
I bet there are a lot of criminals 
who target the gamblers here.

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:52.390
Do you think that robber will get away clean?

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.990
Or will he be shot dead?

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:55.930
Shot dead?

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.730
There's no way he'll escape...

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.130
Then let's bet on it!

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.600
Bet?

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.530
I say he escapes.

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:04.500
Then I bet he gets shot.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.770
The odds are even. Let's say 
whoever wins gets a million.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.550
Don't shoot his brains 
out. I can use it later.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:14.480
Yes, sir!

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.150
Move it!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:18.520
He's coming this way, Toriko-san!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:19.820
Outta my way!

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:20.490
Move!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:21.450
Stop!

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:22.290
Move it!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.220
Somebody grab him!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.090
Fork Shield!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:35.170
Ow!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.270
Are you siding with the thief?

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:44.780
Our aim is the same as yours. 
We just wanted to catch him.

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:46.780
Take him away!

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:52.050
Captured alive! Now that's unusual...

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:54.950
We were both wrong!

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:57.790
With a casino in a crime-filled nation,

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:00.720
I guess it's fitting they'd have 
trigger-happy security guards!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:03.530
Sometimes, there are overzealous 
security guards, but also,

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:09.230
this Gourmet Casino isn't regulated by 
the GGC, the Gourmet Gambling Commission.

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.370
Ow...

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.270
What are you...

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:22.280
The Underground Cooking 
World controls this turf.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:23.710
Match-san!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.750
Long time no see, Match!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:26.520
Hi.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.840
I see.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:51.210
Yeah, come to think of it, your hometown, 
Nerg City, isn't too far from here.

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:54.040
It's been a long time, Shin-san and Rui-san.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.880
You look well, Komatsu.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:59.810
Yep! I'm thrilled to get 
to see all of you again!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:04.690
The Century Soup you made was a big 
hit among the kids in the village.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:05.920
Thank you.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:10.560
My pleasure! I'll make another batch 
any time, so please deliver it to them!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:13.830
Toriko and Coco...

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:17.360
Are two of the Four Kings here to gamble?

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:19.900
Your aim must be one of 
the ingredient prizes.

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:20.700
Of course!

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:25.210
Knowing you two, I bet it's an 
ingredient that's incredibly valuable.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:28.880
One you can't get your hands on without 
access to the exclusive VIP area...

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.180
VIP area?

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:30.840
Boss!

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:32.210
Rum, what's the word?

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:35.320
Like we figured, a ton of dangerous 
ingredients are on the market.

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:37.020
So we were right...

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:37.750
"Boss"?

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:41.690
Match-san, Rum-san just called you "Boss"...

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:45.830
Before, Match-san was indeed number 
two, but now he's the boss.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.390
The former boss, Ryu-san, quit.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:52.530
He quit? Your boss is a well-known, 
influential heavyweight.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:55.170
He works hard enough for ten people! 
Why would he suddenly quit?

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.700
I don't know. He just said he 
had a really big job to do,

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.770
took several of the guys with him, 
and set off for the Gourmet World.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:02.980
The Gourmet World?

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.780
He said he was invited 
by the Reviver, Yosaku,

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.880
but he wouldn't go into 
detail about the objective.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.320
What?! Invited by Yosaku the Reviver?

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.050
Yeah.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:17.360
Ryu-san just told me to take care of the 
Gourmet Mafia's cute sons and Nerg City,

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.060
and then he left.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.260
I could tell I'd never see his back again.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.530
Well, anyway, it's my duty 
now to take over for Ryu-san

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:32.740
by running Nerg City like a tight ship.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:36.510
So what exactly is a mafia boss 
like you doing here in Jiddal,

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.010
a ways from your turf?

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.880
Narcotic ingredients are on 
the streets of Nerg City.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.820
I'm talking hard-core, 
addictive illegal ingredients

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.950
that I've never seen in Nerg City before now.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.620
The Underground Cooking World...

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.760
A criminal organization 
specializing in illegal food

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:56.460
that'd never be served 
in a normal restaurant.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.930
They're flooding the streets

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:01.570
with illegal and narcotic 
ingredients like never before.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.370
And their home base is 
none other than here...

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:06.970
Gourmet Casino...

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:11.170
The Gourmet Casino is run by the Jiddal 
Kingdom, but the king has entrusted

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:14.380
that underground organization with 
overseeing the casino's operations.

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:19.720
So in other words, the Underground 
Cooking World is really in charge here.

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.750
Yeah. And the mastermind

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:26.760
is the boss of the Underground 
Cooking World, Livebearer.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:30.390
He's a dark chef who also works 
as a dealer at the casino.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:34.600
We've come to steal the narcotic 
ingredients that he controls.

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:37.830
I don't wanna see any kid take 
a bite from an Electric Banana!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.400
Match-san...

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:49.010
We can't afford to let 'em peddle any 
more of their filthy poison in our city!

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:53.520
So Match-san, you're going 
into the Gourmet Casino and...

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:56.280
It won't work.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:58.750
Wha...?!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:17:59.920
Coco-san!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:03.960
The few of you against their organization? 
You don't stand a chance.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:05.330
What?!

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:09.360
Coco, one of the Four 
Kings... How do you know?

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:14.040
I'm a fortune teller. If 
you guys are going to win,

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.070
it won't be through force, 
but rather by gambling.

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:26.010
I know this town well... and 
the power of Livebearer, too.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:30.780
Match-san, Shin-san, Rui-san, 
trust in Coco-san here!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:35.220
So you can lose no time in getting rid 
of those illegal, poison ingredients!

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:39.890
Okay, Match-san?!

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.600
Well, you heard the man.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:45.830
How about we go together?

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:46.800
Toriko...

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:49.800
The ingredient we want is in the casino, too.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.540
On the way, let's break the bank,

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.440
confiscate all of their illegal 
ingredient prizes, and go home!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:56.780
Alright?!

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:03.380
Let's go together, Match-san!

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.350
Boss!

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:10.690
Gambling's not my style, but it'd be 
fitting to steal lawfully from them.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.630
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.530
Let's go! Let's go!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.690
It's settled!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:22.470
Ahead is the Gourmet 
Casino's public main area.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.440
Public main area?

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.740
It's nicknamed the "Labyrinth of Desire".

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.010
It's right there!

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:49.030
Wow!

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:54.170
Is all of this casino space?!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:09.950
Komatsu-kun, this is only one part of it.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:32.960
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.900
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:41.140
We're going to use a camera this 
week too, so get yours ready!

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:44.540
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:49.210
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:52.580
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:56.220
Alright, here we go!

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:58.450
A heaping helping...

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:00.150
Open!

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:04.560
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:11.600
B - Ozone Grass (Capture Level 68)

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.760
...yours if you chose B!

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:09.160
If you have fun doing everything you do,

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:11.730
it may just attract a lucky 
special someone to you!

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:19.870
C - Dom Capture Level 19

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:15.500
If you chose C, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.400
Failure breeds success!

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:19.910
If you don't give up, it looks 
like something good could happen!

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:27.650
A - Butt Bug Capture Level < 1

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:23.680
And I'm sorry. If you chose A, you're third.

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:25.680
If something sounds too delicious to be true,

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:27.610
you should take it with a 
heaping helping of salt!

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:31.420
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:32.990
Are you ready?

00:22:32.480 --> 00:22:38.390
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:35.190
If you take a photo of that scene

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:38.360
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:40.390
Alright, here we go!

00:22:40.560 --> 00:22:44.530
Three! Two! One! Scoop chance!

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:46.600
Whether you have good luck...

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:49.170
...or bad luck...

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:52.740
First, you need to eat!

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:56.570
No matter how bad my luck,

00:22:56.570 --> 00:22:59.740
I feel like if I eat 'til I'm full, I'll 
be able to explode right through it!

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:02.550
Alright, I'm gonna eat a 
helping helping of food!

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:05.020
But first, on to the next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:11.060
A cesspool of evil where greed hangs in the air.

00:23:11.060 --> 00:23:13.820
The dark mastermind who laughs in the darkness finally appears!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:17.330
Enter: The Boss of the Underground Cooking World, Livebearer!

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.360
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
